<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- Physical parameters of the mecanum robot. All units SI (m, kg, rad). -->
<!-- REWRITE: the previous model's dimensions, masses and mesh paths were removed for the new
     model (branch feature/model-v2, see REWRITE.md). Define them here again from the new meshes
     and geometry. Other packages consume them:
       - wheel radius: base_joint height (base_footprint on the floor), wheel collision and
         inertia, and wheel_radius in mecanum_base/config/esp32_driver.yaml
       - front/rear axle x and track width: wheel joint origins, and lx (half wheelbase) and ly
         (half track) in esp32_driver.yaml
       - chassis extent, including every mount and sensor: the self-filter box in
         mecanum_localization/config/self_filter.yaml and the planned Nav2 footprint
       - masses and inertias: simulation dynamics only
       - visual and collision mesh paths: meshes/visual and meshes/collision
     Mark uncertain values with STAND-IN comments and list them in STANDINS.md. -->
<robot xmlns:xacro="http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro">

</robot>
